        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 935SQ, Modern Knobset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Knob with Square Rose is available in 8 finishes including polished chrome, satin brass, and oil rubbed bronze. This contemporary knobset has been designed with sharp, clean lines that really help to bring out the modern feel. It is a great choice to bring any door into the modern age. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions. This modern knob is easy to install and will fit doors that are 1-3/8 inches or 1-3/4 inches thick with available 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia 935SQ Modern Knobset with Square Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Full lip strike comes standard.</li>\r\n<li>55° rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Covers 2-1/8\" bore hole.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/prodigy-installation.pdf?v=1704262303\"><b>Omnia Prodigy Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 935SQ Modern Knob with Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-9/16\" square</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on one side of door. Includes 1 knob, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of door. Includes 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy and retract latchbolt. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, privacy button, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern Knob with Square Rose, Omnia 935SQ",
                "description": "Omnia 935SQ, Modern Knob with Square Rose - The Modern Knob with Square Rose is available in 8 finishes including polished chrome, satin brass, and oil rubbed bronze. This contemporary knobset has been designed with sharp, clean lines that really help to bring out the modern feel. It is a great choice to bring any door into the modern age. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions. This modern knob is easy to install and will fit doors that are 1-3/8 inches or 1-3/4 inches thick with available 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
                "keywords": "Omnia 935 Knob with Square Rosettes, Omnia 935SQ, Modern Knob with Square Roses, OMN-935SQ, omnia prodigy collections, solid brass door knobs, Omnia Standard door knobs, modern knobs, passage knobs, privacy knobs, Omnia 935SQ Modern Knob with Square Roses, Modern Knobsets,"
